One real server-side gap is in the detector rail’s analog output: the existing live hook advertises comparator output but always returns zero, while vanilla returns a command-minecart success count or a container-minecart fill level. The workspace already has both minecart variants, inventory calculation, and downcast support, so I’m wiring that existing machinery into the detector hook and adding a small pure clamp regression.
